<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia closing November coffee registrations.</title>
<headline>Colombia closing November coffee registrations.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's National Coffee Growers' Federation said it was closing November coffee registrations for federation exporters as of Thursday, October 24.</p>
<p>The federation already announced that registrations for December shipments by Federation and private exporters had opened as of October 21.</p>
<p>-- Bogota newsroom 571 610 7944</p>
